 "language": "Shell game, and you deal it. Seven cubes, one each of red, orange, yellow, green, blue, indigo and violet, sit in a shuffled row with seven identical white shells parked behind them. Press the GREEN button once: a shell is carried over every cube and set down on it. Then press the BLUE button 5 times; each press down triggers one shuffle, two shells swapping spots with whatever they hide. Keep the arm clear while pieces move. Then build the rainbow. Uncover the cubes in rainbow order: lift the shell off the red cube first, then the one hiding orange, and so on to violet. Leave the seven of them in a straight line running from the GREEN button to the BLUE button, in that same order, with red nearest the green button.",
